# Hosts excluded from the external link check.
#
# Everything here is a host that refuses or cannot serve automated clients, not
# a host with broken links. A URL that is genuinely gone answers 404/410, and
# the checker still reports that — these entries only suppress the responses
# that say "you are a bot" or never answer at all.
#
# Bot-blocking responses that do prove the host is alive (403, 418, 429) are
# handled with `--accept` in the workflow instead, so those hosts stay checked.

# Answers 418 to curl and 502 to the checker behind its redirect chain; a
# browser loads the same URLs fine.
^https://ieeexplore\.ieee\.org/

# Does not respond to requests from outside the university network (plain curl
# times out too), so every check is a false negative.
^https://aaltodoc\.aalto\.fi/
